{"n": 630, "w": 1000, "h": 1309, "img": "630.webp", "text": "33-9\nEccentric silent blocks could be installed to\ncorrect the rear axle toe deviation caused by\nsummation of unfavorable tolerances.\nImportant!\nChanges in alignment geometry caused by\ndamage in an accident may never be “eliminated”\nwith this measure,\n\nMark horizontal position of trailing arm to\ntrailing arm eye.\n\nCheck rear wheel alignment with optical tester Use pertinent angle displacement from following\n32 00 054. diagram.\n\nDetermine correction value. Connect numbers for toe correction on both\nExample: sides of silent block with lines.\n\nActual value, left, rear = + 2.5 mm (0.098\")\nNominal value, left, rear + 2.0 mm (0.079\")\nCorrection value — 0.5 mm (0.019\")\n\nRemove rear wheel 36 10 300.\nRemove and install semi-trailing arm 33 32 000.\n\nCoat silent block with diluted Cresta, lubricat-\ning oi! I or relaxed water,\n\nApply silent block on trailing arm that drawn\nline aligns with mark on trailing arm and pull in\nwith Special Tool 33 3 050.\n\nMount trailing arm and check rear wheel toe.\n\nPull out silent block with Special Too! If the adjustment on the outer silent block is not\n33 3 050. sufficient, an eccentric silent block could also be\ninstalled on inside.\n\n333050", "words": [["33-9", 0.9523, 0.4656, 0.9748, 0.5329], ["Eccentric", 0.9264, 0.2624, 0.9377, 0.307], ["silent", 0.9271, 0.3105, 0.9363, 0.3354], ["blocks", 0.9271, 0.3394, 0.937, 0.3693], ["could", 0.9271, 0.3728, 0.937, 0.3982], ["be", 0.9271, 0.4022, 0.9363, 0.4134], ["installed", 0.9271, 0.4169, 0.9363, 0.4559], ["to", 0.9271, 0.46, 0.935, 0.4691], ["correct", 0.9111, 0.2619, 0.9198, 0.2948], ["the", 0.9111, 0.2994, 0.9211, 0.3146], ["rear", 0.9111, 0.3181, 0.9184, 0.3354], ["axle", 0.9111, 0.3394, 0.9204, 0.3582], ["toe", 0.9111, 0.3617, 0.9191, 0.3764], ["deviation", 0.9111, 0.3799, 0.9211, 0.423], ["caused", 0.9111, 0.4265, 0.9204, 0.458], ["by", 0.9085, 0.4615, 0.9204, 0.4732], ["summation", 0.8952, 0.